Miku Starlight Theme for DeepSeek Harness

Visual target: the user-supplied Miku Codex screenshot.
Artwork, wallpaper, character, mobile variant, polaroid, badge, exclusive tag,
card background, waveform and icons are original files supplied in:
ekko-studio-custom / local/themes/studio/assets.
No character or artwork pixels are redrawn. assets/ORIGIN.json records the
source paths, SHA-256 hashes and sizes. This adaptation grants no additional
rights concerning Hatsune Miku, illustrations, names or trademarks.

Original project: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio
Custom source: https://github.com/cjjchina3088191870-sudo/ekko-studio-custom
The original project license is retained in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.
Original icon licenses are retained in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.
The DeepSeek Harness native theme and plugin APIs are used as dependencies.
No DSH runtime or independent widget implementation is copied into the plugin.

